 r←Test_DisplayButtons_003(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;n;buttons;rf;focusHas;parms
⍝ Exercise "DisplayButtons". Simulates "Cancel.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 buttons←2 3⍴'PDF' 'HTML' 'XML' 'OK' 'Cancel' 'Don''t know'
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForDisplayButtons
 parms.cancelButton←¯1+⍴,buttons
 n←parms ∆DisplayButtons'Please select the appropriate action:'buttons
 rf←parms.cancelButton⊃,n.∆buttons  ⍝ Which button shall have the focus?
 ⎕NQ rf'GotFocus' ⋄ ⎕NQ rf'KeyPress' 'EP'
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'KeyPress' 'ER'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp'Don''t know'≢n.∆buttonPressed.Caption
 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
